[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0530","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0530.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54452","title":"Doyensec safeurl IPv6 CIDR 黑名单缺失导致 SSRF 防护绕过漏洞","description":"safeurl 库的私有网络黑名单（privateNetworks）缺少新加入的 IPv6 CIDR 范围，包括 NAT64 本地使用前缀（64:ff9b:1::/48）、SRv6 SID 段（5f00::/16）、文档前缀（3fff::/20）及虚拟 IPv6 前缀（100:0:0:1::/64）。攻击者可利用这些未屏蔽的 IPv6 地址段绕过安全限制，访问本应被阻止的内部资源。该漏洞影响 safeurl 库 v0.2.4 之前版本，需攻击者能够控制目标应用请求的目标地址。升级至 v0.2.4 或禁用 IPv6 即可修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54452","GHSA-xgch-x3mx-cm3c"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 safeurl 至 v0.2.4 或以上版本，该版本已补充缺失的 IPv6 CIDR 范围（64:ff9b:1::/48、5f00::/16、3fff::/20、100:0:0:1::/64）。如无法立即升级，可通过调用 EnableIPv6(false) 禁用 IPv6 功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/52c217919a6d620361bf48bca12b230aba4042cf/2026/CVE-2026-54452.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/doyensec/safeurl/CVE-2026-54452.yml","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/osv/GO-2026-5997.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-xgch-x3mx-cm3c/GHSA-xgch-x3mx-cm3c.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54452.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes","https://github.com/JimBLogic/CyberDailyLog/blob/98e56ea25f36fdfe6e855955b7a08d4f4ed26469/reports/archive/2026/07/2026-07-16.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29801.yaml","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2026-5997.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/dce39ef8dd24743d0eb60b36b80f49d51f219690/data/history/CVE-2026-54452.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0530.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0530.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0526","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0526.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54451","title":"elixir-protobuf Protobuf 解码器无限递归拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Elixir Protobuf 库（Hex 包 `protobuf`，版本 >= 0.8.0, < 0.16.1）的 `Protobuf.Decoder` 在解码内嵌消息字段时存在无界递归深度漏洞。当 protobuf schema 包含自引用或循环消息类型（如 `message Tree { Tree child = 1; }`）时，攻击者可通过构造特制的 protobuf 二进制数据包，使解码器在 `value_for_field/3` 函数中无限递归。由于递归调用非尾递归，每层嵌套都会在进程栈和堆上保留活动帧，且解码器未设置递归深度上限。攻击者仅需发送一个数 KB 到数 MB 的请求体，即可使目标节点消耗数百 MB 内存和数秒 CPU 时间，数个并发请求即可导致节点离线。参考实现（Google C++/Java）均将递归深度限制为 100 层，而 Elixir 实现未施加此限制，形成请求放大型拒绝服务漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54451","GHSA-rv48-qqj5-crxg"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Elixir protobuf 库升级至 0.16.1 或更高版本（最新 0.17.0），该版本在解码器中添加了递归深度计数器，默认限制为 100 层，超过时抛出 `Protobuf.DecodeError`。如无法立即升级，可在调用 `decode/1` 前对输入 protobuf 二进制数据做大小限制（建议 ≤1MB），并确保服务端不直接解码来自不可信来源的 protobuf 消息。同时检查所有使用了自引用或循环消息类型的 schema，在升级前避免暴露相关解码端点。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c9c8aecfe6c3a13655a4d5ab29ff7bdd3b930e51/2026/CVE-2026-54451.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/a279f62f35d4b13b0efd3915319e4d063fa99b57/posts/cve-2026-54451-erlang-protobuf.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-rv48-qqj5-crxg/GHSA-rv48-qqj5-crxg.json","https://github.com/kubemq-io/kubemq-elixir/blob/ec8f9a188ed84756141c53d86e83a0273c83e633/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54451.json","https://github.com/maxgfr/package-checker.sh/blob/433650e81dc87b0e7eebc5f102c8077f8f1019a0/data/ghsa-hex.purl","https://github.com/JimBLogic/CyberDailyLog/blob/98e56ea25f36fdfe6e855955b7a08d4f4ed26469/reports/archive/2026/07/2026-07-16.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29788.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/dce39ef8dd24743d0eb60b36b80f49d51f219690/data/history/CVE-2026-54451.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/a279f62f35d4b13b0efd3915319e4d063fa99b57/api/intel/products/cve-2026-54451-erlang-protobuf.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0526.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0526.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0524","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0524.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54450","title":"Stacklok ToolHive SSRF防护绕过漏洞","description":"ToolHive 的 SSRF 防护功能存在严重漏洞，其核心原因是手工维护的私有 IP 地址库缺少 IPv6 NAT64 地址范围。具体而言，防护功能使用了 `pkg/networking/utilities.go` 中的 `IsPrivateIP` 函数，该函数仅包含定义在 `privateIPBlocks` 变量中的特定 CIDR 段，包括 `127.0.0.0/8`、`10.0.0.0/8` 等经典私有地址段，但**完全忽略了** IPv6 网络中用于 IPv4/IPv6 互操作的 NAT64 转换范围，包括 RFC 6052 标准中定义的“64:ff9b::/96”前缀和 RFC 8215 中定义的本地使用前缀“64:ff9b:1::/48”。当攻击者控制一个 URL 并通过 CIMD 取景器访问时（例如外部 OAuth 客户端提供的 `client_id=https://<attacker-domain>/path`），如果该 URL 解析为一个 NAT64 地址（如 `64:ff9b:1::a9fe:a9fe` — 这是链接本地元数据地址 `169.254.169.254` 的 NAT64 编码），防护功能则会错误地将其视为公共地址，允许 SSRF 请求得以建立。在这种情况下，攻击者可以借助 NAT64 网关的透明翻译功能，绕过原本应该阻止的连接安全边界，实现对物联网元数据服务或内部主机达成的盲目连通性探测。尽管这类攻击无法直接窃取证书或凭证，但却提供了对目标系统内部网络结构的精确洞察，从而可能为后续攻击行动提供关键信息。这一缺陷广泛存在于 ToolHive 的多个组件，包括 OAuth 认证服务器的 CIMD 取景器、HTTP 客户端的注册/OIDC 发现以及令牌校验机制所共享的 `protectedDialerControl`，以及技能克隆工具的 Git 解析器中，但那些组件的访问权限通常由操作者或用户进行配置。因此，该漏洞是 ToolHive 中 SSRF 防护机制的一个关键设计弱点，可能导致攻击者获取未授权的内部网络访问权限。CVE 编号为 CVE-2026-54450，威胁等级为严重， CVSS 评分高达 9.8。","severity":"LOW","score":3.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54450","GHSA-pph6-vfjv-vpjw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 ToolHive 到 v0.29.1 或更高版本（已在 PR 中修复 pkg/networking/utilities.go 中的 privateIPBlocks，新增 64:ff9b::/96 与 64:ff9b:1::/48 NAT64 前缀，并补充 0.0.0.0/8、::、240.0.0.0/4 等特殊范围）。若暂无法升级，可在防火墙或网络策略层面拦截 64:ff9b::/96 与 64:ff9b:1::/48 目的地址，或临时禁用 IPv6/NAT64 网关作为临时缓解措施。同时建议在部署环境中禁用 IPv6-only 网络栈，强制使用 IPv4 避免 NAT64 转换路径被滥用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c9c8aecfe6c3a13655a4d5ab29ff7bdd3b930e51/2026/CVE-2026-54450.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/stacklok/toolhive/CVE-2026-54450.yml","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/osv/GO-2026-5996.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-pph6-vfjv-vpjw/GHSA-pph6-vfjv-vpjw.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54450.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes","https://github.com/aegisfleet/tool-survey-report/blob/56cac7869254850dcb2586557a76a32f6907c690/_trending/2026-07-16.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29798.yaml","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2026-5996.yaml","https://github.com/JimBLogic/CyberDailyLog/blob/98e56ea25f36fdfe6e855955b7a08d4f4ed26469/reports/archive/2026/07/2026-07-16.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0524.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0522","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0522.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54449","title":"LangBot MCP 配置认证后远程代码执行漏洞","description":"LangBot（一个 AI 对话机器人平台）的 MCP 配置功能存在 OS 命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。已认证的攻击者可通过在 MCP Server 配置中添加恶意的 STDIO 类型服务，传入任意系统命令，导致远程代码执行。攻击者仅需拥有有效账户即可利用该漏洞，可执行数据窃取、反弹 Shell 乃至完全控制服务器等操作。该漏洞影响所有公开部署的 LangBot 实例及同一网络环境下的本地实例。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54449","GHSA-3pvh-63gf-j9mw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即限制 MCP 配置功能的访问权限，仅允许管理员角色操作 STDIO 类型的 MCP 服务端配置，禁止普通用户添加或修改 MCP 配置。在代码层面，对 src/langbot/pkg/provider/tools/loaders/mcp.py 中的 StdioServerParameters 命令参数进行严格白名单校验，拒绝所有非预定义命令。如业务不需要 MCP 扩展功能，建议在管理界面中完全禁用 MCP 选项卡。同时将 LangBot 实例部署在内网并配置防火墙规则，限制来源 IP 访问 Web 管理界面，降低未授权访问风险。关注 LangBot 官方仓库等待补丁发布后立即升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/mcp-security-project/mcp-cve-project/blob/8f19c6692789742733d784a4d63207b68cb14525/cves/CVE-2026-54449.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/langbot/CVE-2026-54449.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c9c8aecfe6c3a13655a4d5ab29ff7bdd3b930e51/2026/CVE-2026-54449.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/a279f62f35d4b13b0efd3915319e4d063fa99b57/cve/CVE-2026-54449.html","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/3926520bcc5671ddd00549bf2242a2082ef49d3d/vulns/langbot/PYSEC-2026-3473.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-3pvh-63gf-j9mw/GHSA-3pvh-63gf-j9mw.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/886e3cd9cda40e2c4ffda31042908f1a83f89624/proposals/ghsa/GHSA-3pvh-63gf-j9mw.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/cataam-security/cataam/blob/8abe63fcd635a50329bf43e2eee16677b9a1e945/tools/README.md","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54449.json","https://github.com/anajuliabit/aeon/blob/bce3e94bcc8a091fd8bc1a13a8b11c0eb002897a/memory/logs/2026-07-16.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0522.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0518","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0518.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54447","title":"Garmin garminconnect OAuth 令牌存储权限分配不当漏洞","description":"garminconnect Python 库（版本 ≤ 0.3.4）在将 OAuth 令牌存储写入磁盘时未设置文件系统权限，在默认 umask 022 下令牌文件 garmin_tokens.json 以全局可读权限（0o644）创建，其中包含 Garmin 刷新令牌。多用户主机上的本地攻击者无需提权即可读取该文件获取刷新令牌，进而通过 Garmin OAuth 端点换取访问令牌，持续访问受害者账户中的健康、运动及设备管理数据，实现本地凭据窃取与权限提升。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54447","GHSA-wjhr-76vg-2hvc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 garminconnect 至 0.3.5 或更高版本：`pip install --upgrade garminconnect`。升级后立即修复已存在的令牌文件权限：`chmod 600 ~/.garminconnect/garmin_tokens.json`。若令牌文件曾在多用户主机上暴露，应删除令牌文件并重新登录以刷新令牌，防止凭据被其他本地用户窃取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/garminconnect/CVE-2026-54447.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/efeaee5bdc1875affd1d4dced4dd0e858922c00e/2026/CVE-2026-54447.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/0bde7ad241dd0e070c73be268acb78555be38fd9/cve/CVE-2026-54447.html","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/3926520bcc5671ddd00549bf2242a2082ef49d3d/vulns/garminconnect/PYSEC-2026-3467.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-wjhr-76vg-2hvc/GHSA-wjhr-76vg-2hvc.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54447.json","https://github.com/ericverret35/opsintel/blob/4c05472f9ad1f89d70ba85bdf08a663c3daf261e/advisories/2026-07-23-pysec-2026-3467.md","https://github.com/JimBLogic/CyberDailyLog/blob/98e56ea25f36fdfe6e855955b7a08d4f4ed26469/reports/archive/2026/07/2026-07-16.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29786.yaml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/0bde7ad241dd0e070c73be268acb78555be38fd9/posts/cve-2026-54447-pip-garminconnect.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0518.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0516","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0516.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54446","title":"NetLicensing netlicensing-mcp HTTP 传输模式认证绕过漏洞","description":"NetLicensing-MCP 在 HTTP 传输模式下存在身份认证缺失漏洞（CWE-306）。ApiKeyMiddleware 中间件在未检测到客户端 API 密钥时，未拒绝请求而是无条件放行至下游处理器，导致下游 HTTP 客户端回退使用服务器环境变量中的 NETLICENSING_API_KEY 进行上游 NetLicensing REST API 认证。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 /mcp 端点发送任意请求，以服务器操作员身份调用所有 MCP 工具，包括产品列表查询、许可证创建/修改及删除等操作，导致机密性（账户数据泄露）、完整性（许可证篡改）和可用性（批量删除）受损。该漏洞影响以 HTTP 模式部署且设置 NETLICENSING_API_KEY 环境变量的 netlicensing-mcp 版本，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54446","GHSA-x9vc-9ffq-p3gj"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 netlicensing-mcp 至修复版本（≥0.1.6），该版本在 ApiKeyMiddleware 中增加了对缺失 API Key 请求的 401 拒绝逻辑。如无法升级，在 HTTP 传输模式下部署时，通过反向代理（如 Nginx）添加 `/mcp` 端点的客户端证书认证或 IP 白名单限制，并避免将 `NETLICENSING_API_KEY` 环境变量暴露给不可信网络。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/netlicensing-mcp/CVE-2026-54446.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d983e79279f1f6283391580f592d754045c7d17d/2026/CVE-2026-54446.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/0bde7ad241dd0e070c73be268acb78555be38fd9/cve/CVE-2026-54446.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-x9vc-9ffq-p3gj/GHSA-x9vc-9ffq-p3gj.json","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/3926520bcc5671ddd00549bf2242a2082ef49d3d/vulns/netlicensing-mcp/PYSEC-2026-3490.yaml","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54446.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/886e3cd9cda40e2c4ffda31042908f1a83f89624/proposals/ghsa/GHSA-x9vc-9ffq-p3gj.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/ericverret35/opsintel/blob/4c05472f9ad1f89d70ba85bdf08a663c3daf261e/advisories/2026-07-23-pysec-2026-3490.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/0bde7ad241dd0e070c73be268acb78555be38fd9/posts/cve-2026-54446-pip-netlicensing-mcp.html","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/f637a1d9c477b365f04814609a546f50c9aa4193/osv/python/netlicensing-mcp/PYSEC-2026-3490.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0516.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0516.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0516.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0510","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0510.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54254","title":"Cyberdrop-DL cyberdrop-dl-patched Pixeldrain API密钥泄露漏洞","description":"cyberdrop-dl-patched 在处理 Pixeldrain URL 时存在 API 密钥泄露漏洞。该工具通过子字符串匹配方式识别 Pixeldrain 域名，攻击者可注册包含 \"pixeldrain\" 子串的恶意域名（如 evil-pixeldrain.com），诱导用户访问后，工具会将包含用户 Pixeldrain API 密钥的 Authorization 请求头发送到攻击者控制的服务器，导致 API 密钥泄露。已在 v9.14.0 版本中修复，采用精确域名匹配替代子字符串匹配。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54254","GHSA-f5pf-q7c7-m3vv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 cyberdrop-dl-patched 升级至 v9.14.0 或更高版本，该版本通过严格匹配官方域名来阻止 API Key 泄露。已使用过 Pixeldrain API Key 的用户应视为密钥已泄露，需登录 Pixeldrain 账户删除并重新生成 API Key。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/cyberdrop-dl-patched/CVE-2026-54254.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d983e79279f1f6283391580f592d754045c7d17d/2026/CVE-2026-54254.json","https://github.com/Cyberdrop-DL/cyberdrop-dl/blob/a1a27d8b19b1ec7bed65fa0f11836915575929b5/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/3926520bcc5671ddd00549bf2242a2082ef49d3d/vulns/cyberdrop-dl-patched/PYSEC-2026-3460.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-f5pf-q7c7-m3vv/GHSA-f5pf-q7c7-m3vv.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54254.json","https://github.com/ericverret35/opsintel/blob/4c05472f9ad1f89d70ba85bdf08a663c3daf261e/advisories/2026-07-23-pysec-2026-3460.md","https://github.com/aegisfleet/tool-survey-report/blob/ec211968f1160486affa4460bdd3da97e15acd40/_trending/2026-07-16.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29803.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/dce39ef8dd24743d0eb60b36b80f49d51f219690/data/history/CVE-2026-54254.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0510.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0506","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0506.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54247","title":"Zalando Skipper 准入 Webhook 无限制请求体读取致内存耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Skipper 的 Kubernetes 准入 Webhook 处理程序在读取请求体时使用 `io.ReadAll(r.Body)` 且未设置任何大小限制。集群内具有网络访问权限的攻击者可通过向 Webhook 端点发送数 GB 大小的恶意请求体，导致 Skipper 进程内存耗尽并被 OOM 杀死，从而中断 Ingress 和 RouteGroup 资源的准入控制。与 OPA 过滤器（已设置 1MB 默认请求体大小限制）不同，准入处理程序缺乏类似保护机制。Kubernetes kubelet 会自动重启被 OOM 杀死的进程，但重启期间准入控制功能不可用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54247","GHSA-cwxq-rc9x-2jvv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Skipper 至包含修复的版本，在 admission webhook 处理函数中调用 `http.MaxBytesReader(r.Body, 1<<20)` 限制请求体最大为 1MB，参考 OPA filter 的 `DefaultMaxRequestBodySize` 实现。如无法升级，可在网络层面限制对 webhook 端口（默认 :9443）的访问来源，仅允许受信任的 kube-apiserver IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/zalando/skipper/CVE-2026-54247.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08dd01d2afe07e26f91adabe6c565e0dd61b27ab/2026/CVE-2026-54247.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/osv/GO-2026-6015.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-cwxq-rc9x-2jvv/GHSA-cwxq-rc9x-2jvv.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54247.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes","https://github.com/JimBLogic/CyberDailyLog/blob/98e56ea25f36fdfe6e855955b7a08d4f4ed26469/reports/archive/2026/07/2026-07-18.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29886.yaml","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2026-6015.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/dce39ef8dd24743d0eb60b36b80f49d51f219690/data/history/CVE-2026-54247.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0506.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0506.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0506.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0504","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0504.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54246","title":"Zalando Skipper routesrv 组件未授权访问漏洞","description":"Skipper 路由服务 routesrv 组件的所有 API 端点缺乏身份认证机制，将完整的集群路由拓扑（Ingress/RouteGroup 配置、后端 URL、过滤器链、OAuth/OIDC 回调路径）以及缓存集群拓扑（Redis/Valkey 分片地址）通过明文 HTTP 暴露。攻击者只需在 Kubernetes 集群中攻陷任意 Pod（通过应用漏洞、供应链攻击或恶意容器镜像），即可通过 routesrv 的可预测 DNS 名称直接访问 `/routes`、`/swarm/redis/shards` 等端点，获取跨命名空间的集群级敏感数据，进而实施缓存层攻击（限流数据篡改、会话数据窃取）。该漏洞本质上是控制平面数据泄露，影响机密性，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54246","GHSA-5587-2x54-jj6h"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即为 routesrv 组件添加认证机制，在启动参数中通过 `-route-server-filters` 配置 bearer token 或 mTLS 认证过滤器；同时部署 Kubernetes NetworkPolicy 限制仅数据面 skipper Pod 可访问 routesrv（端口 9090），拒绝所有其他来源的入站流量；如使用 Redis/Valkey 缓存集群，应启用密码认证并限制 routesrv 所在节点的网络访问范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/zalando/skipper/CVE-2026-54246.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/eaf2b224ab7170ed3d0f921813419a61df5eec73/2026/CVE-2026-54246.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/osv/GO-2026-6018.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-5587-2x54-jj6h/GHSA-5587-2x54-jj6h.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54246.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes","https://github.com/mindyoumh/my-ailounge/blob/d8c84c82ad390de87727e202006aa179880ba61b/docs/feeds/08-security-alerts.md","https://github.com/Huangu0/sec_rss_news/blob/c46faafa70787fe2612f0051de58d5a05bef4d0b/output/daily/2026-07-19.md","https://github.com/JimBLogic/CyberDailyLog/blob/98e56ea25f36fdfe6e855955b7a08d4f4ed26469/reports/archive/2026/07/2026-07-18.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29903.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0504.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0504.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0496","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0496.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54174","title":"Chainguard melange 软件包完整性验证不完整漏洞","description":"melange/Apko 软件包完整性验证存在缺陷，仅校验了控制段（如 .PKGINFO）哈希与已签名 APKINDEX 的一致性，但未对数据段（实际安装的包文件）哈希进行验证。攻击者通过劫持镜像源、投毒缓存或中间人攻击替换包内容时，控制段校验仍可通过，导致任意文件内容被替换。该漏洞影响使用 Apko/melange 构建 Alpine 软件包的系统，攻击者可在无认证条件下实施供应链投毒攻击，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54174","GHSA-fpg8-7664-jc5q"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 melange 升级至 v0.50.4 或更高版本，将 apko 升级至 v1.2.9 或更高版本。这两个版本已增加对 APK 数据段哈希的完整性校验。如无法立即升级，应在网络层面限制对不可信 APK 镜像源的访问，并启用 HTTPS 传输层加密和签名验证以降低中间人攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0496.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0488","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0488.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-14266","title":"7-Zip XZ 解压堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"7-Zip 在处理 XZ 压缩格式的解压过程中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于 7-Zip 对特制 XZ 压缩文件解压时未正确验证输入数据长度，导致堆内存越界写入。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开恶意构造的 XZ 压缩文件触发此漏洞，在目标系统上实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Linux 平台上的 7-Zip 及 p7zip 软件包，涉及 Debian、Ubuntu 等多个发行版。ZDI 已收录此漏洞（ZDI-CAN-30169），目前厂商尚未发布官方补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-14266"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级到 7-Zip 26.02 或更高版本（官方于 2025 年 6 月 25 日发布修复），从 https://www.7-zip.org 手动下载安装。该版本修复了 C/XzDec.c 中 MixCoder_Code 函数的堆缓冲区溢出问题。对于内嵌 7-Zip XZ 解码器的第三方产品，需联系厂商获取对应补丁。临时缓解措施：不要使用 7-Zip 打开来自不可信来源的 XZ 格式压缩包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/6695f20ae08803f774b618dbe76c2549e17160e7/2026/CVE-2026-14266.json","https://github.com/oscs1024/VulnIntel/blob/d30a475530366858ce5fbe93bf9aa03ac85ed76b/2026-07/7-Zip%20XZ%20%E8%A7%A3%E5%8E%8B%E5%A0%86%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20(CVE-2026-14266).md","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/dd354ae8f6b28f51c3ead113917031fa919a65c7/2026/CVE-2026-14266/CVE-2026-14266.py","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-14266.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CVE-2026-14266-2026-07-27-0205","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/c8d1b7aea5d2d5441e2a0fa8f2147be9cd1dabf4/Today.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-14266","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/32f399c24533d9981e4362ffb2eb46217d93911e/2026/CVE-2026-14266.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/212206c2ec21e624190900d1700e89f42fe1b7c6/cve/CVE-2026-14266.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/46f9dbe7248f9a5a04dd8c08c19437dadee36f24/references/contrib1-CVE-2026-14266-2026-07-27-0205","https://github.com/4minx/CVE-2026-14266","https://github.com/liyuxuan504-byte/CVE-2026-14266","https://github.com/hg0434hongzh0/CVE-2026-14266"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0488.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0486","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0486.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54136","title":"Windmill 资源作用域API令牌路径限制绕过漏洞","description":"Windmill 存在资源作用域 API 令牌授权绕过漏洞。该平台支持格式为 `{domain}:{action}[:{resource}]` 的作用域令牌，但路由级作用域检查仅验证令牌的 domain 和 action，未对 resource/path 部分进行校验。攻击者持有路径受限的 `scripts:read:{resource}` 令牌时，可通过 `GET /api/w/{workspace}/scripts/list_search` 端点获取工作区中所有脚本的 path 和 content，而不仅限于其被授权的路径前缀。这可能导致内部自动化逻辑、集成详情、业务逻辑、内联配置甚至硬编码的凭据泄露。攻击者无需管理员权限，仅需持有有效的资源作用域 API 令牌即可利用。该漏洞影响 Windmill <= 1.714.1 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54136","GHSA-2ppx-66jv-wpw5"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 windmill 升级到 1.715.0 或更高版本（`cargo update -p windmill-api` 或从 GitHub Releases 下载新版本部署）。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（Nginx/Cloudflare）对 `GET /api/w/{workspace}/scripts/list_search` 端点添加访问控制，限制仅允许拥有完整 `scripts:read` 权限的 token 访问，或临时禁用资源级 scope token 的脚本读取功能作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/cargo/windmill-api/CVE-2026-54136.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/234292e761038217f8af6f005669a4adcedb440f/2026/CVE-2026-54136.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-2ppx-66jv-wpw5/GHSA-2ppx-66jv-wpw5.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54136.json","https://github.com/maxgfr/package-checker.sh/blob/433650e81dc87b0e7eebc5f102c8077f8f1019a0/data/osv-cargo.purl","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29649.yaml","https://github.com/maxgfr/package-checker.sh/blob/433650e81dc87b0e7eebc5f102c8077f8f1019a0/data/ghsa-cargo.purl","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/f637a1d9c477b365f04814609a546f50c9aa4193/osv/rust/windmill-api/GHSA-2ppx-66jv-wpw5.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/data/vendors/github/advisories/2026/ghsa-2ppx-66jv-wpw5/advisory.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0486.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0486.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0485","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0485.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13309","title":"Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home NFC栈缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home 电动汽车充电桩的 NFC 接口存在基于栈的缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞在 Pwn2Own 2026 黑客大赛中被披露。攻击者可通过物理接触设备，向 NFC 读卡器发送特制的卡片响应数据，触发固定长度栈缓冲区溢出，从而在设备上下文中执行任意代码。利用该漏洞无需任何身份认证，攻击者只需持有特制 NFC 卡片或模拟 NFC 设备靠近充电桩即可完成攻击。成功利用可导致攻击者完全控制设备，进而可能操纵充电过程、窃取用户信息或将设备作为跳板攻击内部网络。该漏洞影响 Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home 系列产品，厂商已在固件版本 V1.40.81 中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13309"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home 充电桩固件升级至 V1.40.81 或更高版本。该漏洞通过 NFC 接口触发，需物理接触设备，因此除升级外还应限制充电桩的物理访问权限，将设备部署在受控区域，并禁用非必要的 NFC 读卡功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/RogoLabs/GhostCVEs/blob/f4fa13677cfb779d11c65819551d752402c8b4a2/reports/ghost_report.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/6b55e3ba1a5f6029db981377240e35731b742a92/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-435.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cve_news/blob/67e7c8e99992c9a46d801dc18838a34675b567ae/news/2026/07/2026-07-15.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0485.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0484","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0484.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13308","title":"Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home WebSocket 整数下溢远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home 电动汽车充电桩的 OCPP 服务在处理 WebSocket 消息时存在整数下溢漏洞。由于对用户提供的数据缺乏正确验证，在分配缓冲区前发生整数下溢，导致内存破坏。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络向目标设备发送特制的 WebSocket 消息触发该漏洞，成功利用可在设备上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home 系列产品，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。该漏洞在 Pwn2Own 黑客大赛中被披露，厂商已在固件版本 V1.40.81 中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13308"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home 充电桩固件升级至 V1.40.81 或更高版本，该版本已修复 OCPP WebSocket 消息处理中的整数下溢漏洞。如无法立即升级，建议在防火墙/网关上限制充电桩的 443/80 端口对外访问，仅允许与官方 OCPP 服务器的必要通信，并禁用不必要的远程管理功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/RogoLabs/GhostCVEs/blob/f4fa13677cfb779d11c65819551d752402c8b4a2/reports/ghost_report.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/6b55e3ba1a5f6029db981377240e35731b742a92/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-437.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cve_news/blob/67e7c8e99992c9a46d801dc18838a34675b567ae/news/2026/07/2026-07-15.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0484.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0482","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0482.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13307","title":"Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home USB堆缓冲区溢出任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home 电动汽车充电桩在处理自定义 USB 数据包时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于设备未对用户提交的数据长度进行有效验证，直接将数据复制到固定长度的堆缓冲区中，导致缓冲区溢出。物理接触攻击者无需任何认证即可通过特制 USB 设备触发该漏洞，实现以设备权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home 系列产品，厂商已在固件版本 V1.40.81 中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13307"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home 固件升级至 V1.40.81 或更高版本，可通过 Autel 官方管理后台或 USB 本地升级。如无法立即升级，应限制对充电桩 USB 端口的物理访问，将设备部署在受控区域并加装 USB 防篡改封条，同时监控异常 USB 设备接入行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/RogoLabs/GhostCVEs/blob/f4fa13677cfb779d11c65819551d752402c8b4a2/reports/ghost_report.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/6b55e3ba1a5f6029db981377240e35731b742a92/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-436.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cve_news/blob/67e7c8e99992c9a46d801dc18838a34675b567ae/news/2026/07/2026-07-15.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0482.toml"}]